@startuml intercom-sequence-nfc
' NFC 碰触模式 — 完整交互时序图
' 导出: plantuml -tpng -scale 2 intercom-sequence-nfc.puml

skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2.5
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam maxmessagesize 280
skinparam boxPadding 16
skinparam participantPadding 70
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
  BorderColor #3B82F6
  FontColor #1E3A5F
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #F3E8FF
  BorderColor #9333EA
  FontColor #4C1D95
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBEB
  BorderColor #F59E0B
  FontColor #78350F
  FontSize 11
}

title **NFC 碰触模式 — 完整交互流程**
footer 智能错题本 · NFC 碰触模式 P2P 分享

actor "**发送端**\n(Sender)" as S
participant "HCE\nService" as H #F3E8FF
actor "**接收端**\n(Receiver)" as R

|||
hnote over S #EBF5FF: 阶段一: 发送端准备与 BLE 广播
|||

S -> S: 创建 SharePayload\nNfcShareCodec.encode()
S -> S: startAdvertising(data, sessionId)
S -> H: setSessionData(sessionId)
hnote over H #FEF3C7: HCE 就绪 · AID=F05A4C4541524E\nGATT Server 已启动\n⊳ NOTIFY Char (数据通道)\n⊳ WRITE Char (ACK 回传)

|||
hnote over R #EBF5FF: 阶段二: NFC HCE 会话发现
|||

R -> H: NFC 碰触\n(IsoDep.connect())
R -> H: SELECT AID APDU\n00 A4 04 00 07 F05A4C4541524E 00
H --> R: 9000 (OK)
R -> H: READ BINARY APDU\n00 B0 00 00 00
H --> R: sessionId bytes + 9000
hnote over R #FFF7ED: 获得 sessionId\n(IsoDep 路径优先,\n失败降级 NDEF/TagID)

|||
hnote over S,R #EBF5FF: 阶段三: BLE 连接与通知订阅
|||

R -> S: connectGatt(autoConnect=false)
R -> S: requestMtu(517)
S --> R: MTU=517
R -> S: discoverServices()
R -> S: setCharacteristicNotification(NOTIFY, true)
R -> S: writeDescriptor(CCCD, ENABLE_NOTIFICATION)
activate H #FFF7ED
H -> S: onDescriptorWriteRequest\n(检测到订阅)
deactivate H

|||
hnote over S,R #EBF5FF: 阶段四: NOTIFY 推送数据 (Indication)
|||

S -> S: sleep 300ms\n(等待连接稳定)
S --> R: notifyCharacteristicChanged\n首片: [4B 总长度 + data[0..N]]
R -> R: 解析总长度\n累积 buffer
S --> R: notifyCharacteristicChanged\n片2: [data[N+1..M]]
loop 逐片发送 (每片 ≤500B, 间隔 40ms)
  S --> R: notifyCharacteristicChanged\n...
end
R -> R: 累积达到总长度\n拼接完整 JSON

|||
hnote over S,R #EBF5FF: 阶段五: 校验、导入与 ACK
|||

R -> R: NfcShareCodec.decode(data)\n校验 payload.sessionId == nfcSessionId
R -> R: 逐条构建 QuestionEntity\n写入 Room 数据库
R -> S: writeCharacteristic(WRITE, "ACK:sessionId")
S -> S: onCharacteristicWriteRequest\n→ onAckReceived()
hnote over S #E0F2FE: 状态 → Completed\n清理 HCE + BLE 广播

@enduml
